pair, and utility installation projects. This versatile tool provides exceptional durability and efficiency, making it a valuable asset for any rental fleet.','Chicago Pneumatic (CP)','CP-9',280.00,1400.00,4800.00,'fixed','https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1774781063957-b1606sjxcb7.jpg','Weight: 9.3 kg | Length: 570 mm | Air Consumption: 27 l/s (57 CFM) | Blows per Minute: 1700 bpm | Shank Size: 22 x 82.5 mm (7/8\" x 3-1/4\") | Piston Diameter: 41 mm | Stroke: 48 mm | Air Inlet: 3/4\" NPT | Noise Level: 108 dB(A) | Vibration Level: 14.5 m/s²','good','available',2,1,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:13','2026-04-02 03:52:07',60011,NULL,'approved',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(17,13,'Pneumatic Breaker','The Toku TCA-7 Pneumatic Breaker is a robust and reliable tool designed for demanding demolition and breaking tasks in Hong Kong\'s diverse construction environments. Its powerful impact mechanism efficiently tackles concrete, asphalt, and masonry, making it an essential asset for rental fleets and contractors requiring high performance and durability. This breaker is ideal for road repairs, foundation work, and general demolition, offering consistent power output for sustained operation.','Toku','TCA-7',280.00,1350.00,4500.00,'fixed','https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1774793057216-zrxkdfffew.png','Weight: 7.2 kg (15.9 lbs) | Length: 460 mm (18.1 inches) | Shank Size: 22 x 82.5 mm (7/8\" x 3-1/4\") | Blows Per Minute: 2300 bpm | Air Consumption: 1.0 m3/min (35.3 cfm) | Air Inlet: 3/4\" NPT | Working Pressure: 6.3 bar (90 psi)','good','available',3,3,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:14','2026-04-02 03:46:44',64,NULL,'approved',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(18,4,'TD Pro Pipe Stand','Tired of wrestling with heavy pipes on your next plumbing or electrical project? Our TD Pro Pipe Stand is your extra pair of hands, making precise cuts and secure threading a breeze, whether you\'re tackling a new bathroom renovation or running conduit in a tight Mong Kok flat. This sturdy stand brings stability to your workspace, saving your back and ensuring perfectly aligned work every time.','TD Company','TD1108AP',210.00,1050.00,4200.00,'fixed','https://via.placeholder.com/400x300?text=TD%20Pro%20Pipe%20Stand',NULL,'good','available',4,4,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:14','2026-05-18 12:48:51',30,NULL,'rejected',0,'[\"https://www.td.com/content/dam/tdct/images/business-banking/bb-ms-productlisting-luxe-6200m-wireless-548x344.png\"]',NULL,NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(19,30002,'PU Pump Large (Minion)','Got a stubborn puddle or a flooded basement from a surprise typhoon? Our powerful \"Minion\" PU pump, small but mighty, makes quick work of draining water from construction sites or even your backyard in a flash. Forget the backache – this little workhorse handles serious water removal with ease, getting you back on track faster.',NULL,'MPX 3251',470.00,2370.00,9460.00,'fixed','https://via.placeholder.com/400x300?text=PU%20Pump%20Large%20(Minio',NULL,'good','available',1,1,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:14','2026-05-18 12:48:14',30001,NULL,'rejected',0,'[\"http://www.sigsauer.com/media/catalog/product/m/p/mpx-k.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/66c77047-a175-4cc9-8af3-0ca6c9324c59.__CR0,0,1464,600_PT0_SX1464_V1___.jpg\",\"https://media.focenter.com/catalog/product/cache/ace1e0540616bfee74d190306acf864c/P/R/PR173BI6607_13654_DE_MPX_w_Connector_Housing_incl_Bracket_Delrin_AF_Adapter_IMD.jpg\",\"https://tieline.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/Product-of-the-Year-Award-scaled.jpg\"]',NULL,NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(21,12,'3HP air compressor','The OTS-1500 3HP air compressor is a robust and reliable solution for various construction and workshop applications across Hong Kong, offering consistent air delivery for pneumatic tools and equipment. Its powerful motor and efficient design make it ideal for tasks ranging from spray painting and nailing to powering impact wrenches on job sites. This compressor is a versatile asset for rental fleets, providing essential utility for both small-scale projects and larger construction endeavors.',NULL,'OTS-1500',200.00,950.00,3200.00,'fixed','https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1774781009212-w8rkfl92zai.webp','Power: 3 HP (2.2 kW) | Tank Capacity: 50 Liters | Max Pressure: 8 Bar (116 PSI) | Air Delivery (FAD): 200 L/min (7.1 CFM) | Voltage: 220-240V, 50Hz, Single Phase | Weight: Approximately 45 kg | Dimensions: Approximately 750 x 350 x 700 mm (L x W x H) | Noise Level: 90 dB(A)','good','maintenance',1,1,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:14','2026-03-29 15:32:31',60,NULL,'approved',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(22,11,'Tool Briefcase','Tired of rummaging for that lost drill bit or misplaced screwdriver on your latest flat renovation? Grab this sturdy Makita Tool Briefcase and keep your essentials organized and protected, whether you\'re tackling a quick fix in Tsuen Wan or a full-scale DIY project in Sai Kung. It’s the smart, no-fuss way to transport your gear safely and efficiently, ensuring you spend more time building and less time searching.','Makita','823300-9',110.00,530.00,2100.00,'fixed','https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1774780985064-6kczd3k7dyf.jpg',NULL,'good','available',2,2,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:15','2026-04-02 03:46:44',57,NULL,'approved',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(23,5,'Welding Rod Warmers','The ING K-110-A Welding Rod Warmer is an essential piece of equipment for construction sites and workshops in Hong Kong, ensuring optimal performance of welding electrodes by maintaining them at precise temperatures. This portable and robust unit prevents moisture absorption, which is critical for achieving strong, defect-free welds, especially in Hong Kong\'s humid climate. It\'s ideal for demanding applications requiring high-quality welding results and extended electrode lifespan.','ING','K-110-A',180.00,850.00,2800.00,'fixed','https://via.placeholder.com/400x300?text=ING%20Welding%20Rod%20Warm','Capacity: 5-10 kg (approx. 200-300 rods) | Operating Temperature: 50-200°C (adjustable) | Power: 220V/50Hz, 300W | Dimensions: 150 x 150 x 500 mm | Weight: 5 kg | Insulation: High-efficiency thermal insulation | Material: Durable steel construction','good','available',2,2,NULL,1,0,'2026-03-28 13:22:15','2026-05-12 23:08:04',35,'https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1778627284706-vuw36oxxhs8.jpg','pending',1,'[\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/f99c7f59-5885-4216-ac40-15ddcfcbcc83.__CR0,0,488,700_PT0_SX488_V1___.jpg\",\"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/95b1356f-fa67-4e8f-9577-4e479fb86fd0.__CR0,0,488,700_PT0_SX488_V1___.jpg\",\"https://www.tuli-shop.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/image/654x654/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/K/1/K110.A16.12UKF.webp\",\"https://5.imimg.com/data5/ANDROID/Default/2026/3/594340118/MH/OQ/KN/194947578/product-jpeg-1000x1000.jpg\",\"https://kiddolino.cdn.shoprenter.hu/custom/kiddolino/image/cache/w1719h900q100/productmaja/315047.jpeg.webp?lastmod=1740929873.1582213581\",\"https://www.behaelter-kg.de/media/catalog/product/cache/4c54125f062bf26160bb6e241a5e0899/p/1/p1140279_1024x1024_1024x1024_.jpg\",\"https://www.franke.com/product-images/ALL/1000-1x1/PP001_125.0507.823.jpg?im=Resize=(1200,630)\",\"https://markabzar.ir/shop-resources/qoVeazA3U8/product-images/1686410553_55359.jpg\",\"http://bsg-i.nbxc.com/product/e1/2d/77/705a5c5c98b5cde17f414555fb.jpg\"]','https://res-de.rdmcenter.com/stc/home_product/ingco/userfiles/1/images/photo/20231123110000490/ING-UMMA16069.jpg',NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(24,5,'Gas Torches','Need to solder some copper pipes for that new bathroom reno or blast through a stubborn ru