qpxwk1i.jpg','pending',0,'[\"https://static.rapidonline.com/catalogueimages/product/91/97/s91-9736p01wj.jpg\"]','https://www.zoro.com/static/cms/product/full/Hanes Supply Inc dba Empire Rigging Supply_yalexxhoistxx5274xx909285.jpeg',NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(120004,90001,'Electric Chain Hoist 1 Tonne','Compact electric chain hoist with variable-speed control, integrated overload protection, and a low-headroom design. Suitable for production lines, workshops, and temporary overhead lifting rigs where speed and precision matter.','Demag','DC-Pro 1',550.00,2200.00,6500.00,'fixed',NULL,'SWL: 1T | Lift: 6m | Voltage: 220V single-phase | Speed: 8m/min | Weight: 22kg','excellent','available',1,1,NULL,1,0,'2026-04-03 01:19:56','2026-04-17 02:48:23',90001,'https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1776394103256-y1ycmbwdw3q.jpg','pending',0,'[\"https://www.solutionlevage.com/media/catalog/product/cache/1/image/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95/p/a/palan-electrique-a-chaine-demag-dc-pro-service-intensif-triphase-380-volts-avec-chariot-manuel-ru_1_.jpg\",\"https://www.liftinggeardirect.co.uk/image/cache/catalog/optimizedimages/electric hoists/demag-dc-pro-electric-hoist-843x800.jpg\"]','https://www.industrietec-automation.com/media/image/product/62983/sm/demag-dc-pro-1-1-h5-kettenzug.jpg',NULL,'none',NULL,NULL),(120005,90001,'Lever Hoist (Tirfor) 1.5 Tonne','Ratchet lever hoist providing precise load positioning in any orientation — horizontal, vertical, or angled. The all-steel body and sealed mechanism make it reliable in wet or dusty site conditions.','Tractel','Tralift TS',200.00,800.00,2400.00,'fixed',NULL,'SWL: 1.5T | Lift: 1.5m per pull | Weight: 5.8kg | Finish: Zinc-plated','good','available',1,1,NULL,1,0,'2026-04-03 01:19:56','2026-04-17 02:48:00',90001,'https://d2xsxph8kpxj0f.cloudfront.net/310519663429127370/EqJqhhxWWJKtKB68YEvggw/equipment-photos/1776394080266-a4jm4smqcy7.jpg','pending',0,'[\"https://m.media-amazon